# --- Secrets : ne JAMAIS commiter la clé API ---
.env

# --- Build Maven ---
target/

# --- Genere : graphe de code (regenerable via `graphify update .`) ---
graphify-out/

# --- Cache de reponses OCR (adresse par contenu, regenerable en re-appelant l'API) ---
.ocr-cache/

# --- Config assistant IA (local, hors projet) ---
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# --- Documents d'exemple (plans internes, potentiellement confidentiels) ---
